WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Juri dashes and whiffs the first crouching jab.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.150
The next crouching jab connects on wake-up.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.750
Standing medium kick links from the late jab.

4
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.750
The medium kick cancels into heavy Fuhajin.

5
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.100
Heavy Tensenrin finishes the corner conversion.
